      "q_source": "stage2_test_predictions.csv",
      "step_number": 2,
      "text": "Step 2: According to the problem, the sum of all but one of its interior angles is \\( 1070^\\circ \\). Therefore, if we let the missing angle be \\( x \\), then the sum of all interior angles minus this one angle is \\( 1070^\\circ \\). This can be written as:\n\\[ (n-2) \\times 180^\\circ - x = 1070^\\circ \\]",
